{"seq":5,"slug":"public-security","title":"公安学","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/education/university/law/public-security","introMarkdown":"# 公安学 简介\n\n公安学以维护社会秩序和公共安全为核心目标，系统研究犯罪现象的规律、警务活动的原理以及刑事侦查与治安管理的方法体系。这一学科既具有深厚的法学和社会学理论根基，又高度强调实务操作和应急处置能力，是理论与实践结合最为紧密的社会科学门类之一。\n\n本知识体系从警察制度与理论出发，经由犯罪学的因果分析，延伸到治安管理的日常运作和刑事技术的科学方法，为自学者提供全面的公安学知识地图。\n\n第一章**警察学**讨论现代警察制度的理论基础、警务组织的职能与权力边界，介绍犯罪侦查的基本程序和取证策略，并探讨社区警务模式如何通过预防导向降低犯罪率。\n\n第二章**犯罪学**从生物学、心理学和社会学多重视角分析犯罪行为的成因，讨论犯罪预防的理论模型和实践策略，并专题关注未成年人犯罪的特殊规律与矫治路径。\n\n第三章**治安管理**聚焦公共场所秩序的维护机制、突发事件的应急响应流程以及道路交通安全管理的制度与技术手段，展示公安工作如何在日常运行层面保障社会安全。\n\n第四章**刑事技术**介绍物证鉴定的科学原理、数字取证在网络犯罪侦查中的应用，以及犯罪现场勘查的标准化流程，让自学者了解技术手段如何为司法公正提供客观依据。\n\n建议自学者先从警察学和犯罪学建立理论认知，再进入治安管理了解实务运作，最后学习刑事技术掌握科学方法。结合真实案例进行分析是加深理解的最佳途径。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"police-science","title":"警察学","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/law/public-security/police-science","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"policing-theory","title":"警务理论","url":"/education/university/law/public-security/police-science/policing-theory"},{"seq":2,"slug":"criminal-investigation","title":"刑事侦查","url":"/education/university/law/public-security/police-science/criminal-investigation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"community-policing","title":"社区警务","url":"/education/university/law/public-security/police-science/community-policing"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"criminology","title":"犯罪学","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/law/public-security/criminology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"crime-theories","title":"犯罪理论","url":"/education/university/law/public-security/criminology/crime-theories"},{"seq":2,"slug":"crime-prevention","title":"犯罪预防","url":"/education/university/law/public-security/criminology/crime-prevention"},{"seq":3,"slug":"juvenile-delinquency","title":"青少年犯罪","url":"/education/university/law/public-security/criminology/juvenile-delinquency"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"security-management","title":"治安管理","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/law/public-security/security-management","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"public-order-management","title":"治安管理","url":"/education/university/law/public-security/security-management/public-order-management"},{"seq":2,"slug":"emergency-response","title":"应急响应","url":"/education/university/law/public-security/security-management/emergency-response"},{"seq":3,"slug":"traffic-management","title":"交通管理","url":"/education/university/law/public-security/security-management/traffic-management"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"forensic-science","title":"刑事技术","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/law/public-security/forensic-science","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"forensic-evidence","title":"法庭证据","url":"/education/university/law/public-security/forensic-science/forensic-evidence"},{"seq":2,"slug":"digital-forensics","title":"数字取证","url":"/education/university/law/public-security/forensic-science/digital-forensics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"crime-scene-investigation","title":"犯罪现场勘查","url":"/education/university/law/public-security/forensic-science/crime-scene-investigation"}]}]}